         than 0.16.0 offered.
         THE COLLAPSE RAISES THE BAR RATHER THAN LEVELLING IT (#1710: do not weaken an alarm to make
         the collapse easier). Three ways, each measured:
           * PARTIAL VIEWS are graded per-skill by IDENTITY. All seven hand-copies compared DIRECTORY
             COUNTS (`find … -type d | wc -l`), which passes a view whose skills are named nothing
